569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\mathrm{Sentence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\mathrm{Sentence}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"dba31c144607e57b\" href=\"?note=dba31c144607e57b\" title=\"88-df-countable\">88-df-countable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}countable\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Term}_S)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Sent}_S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}countable\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Term}_S)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}(\\mathrm{Sent}_S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}countable\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sentence}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}countable\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sentence}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>变量由自然数编号。签名可数时，每个元数的符号集可数；在项和公式的每个有限构造深度上，只作可数并、有限积与可数集合的像。因此逐深度归纳得到项、原子式和公式均可数；句子集是公式集的子集。最后一个断言展开句子定义，把从签名、语法到句子的联系正式保留在断言中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-signature-size","status":"resolved","id":"da378af7f2f57e43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-signature-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep